
config ARMV8_RESET_ON_EXCEPTION
    bool "Reset after an unhandled exception"
    depends on ARCH_ARMV8
    default n
    help
        After printing an unhandled exception, call plat_reset() instead
        of hanging. Without it, only the watchdog or a debugger ends the
        hang. On sunxi with SUNXI_FEL_RETURN, plat_reset() returns to FEL,
        so the RAM log with the exception can be read over USB.
